{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PorBor is a Metroidvania where you explore a civilization mutated by nature and gods alike, all stemming from one destructive event. You are &quot;Bor&quot; and need to wander around while finding different items, abilities, colorful yet haunting locations, and importantly... Bugs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is quick and reactionary. Bosses and enemies alike will force to you act fast and take risks. Supported by the movement which is snappy and\u00a0untethered</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Kilt&quot;</strong>\u00a0appears when you draw blood from foes. Giving you health and strength. Kilt is pushed away from you when created, meaning if you want it you have to remain close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of different bosses to defeat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755100/extras/eabeac942d5ce5e266c23b56a2afab54.poster.avif?t=1766732363\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755100/extras/eabeac942d5ce5e266c23b56a2afab54.webm?t=1766732363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755100/extras/eabeac942d5ce5e266c23b56a2afab54.mp4?t=1766732363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find countless characters throughout this land... Who vary in sanity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755100/extras/666be072efa5c53ee47637456b9ccc25.poster.avif?t=1766732363\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755100/extras/666be072efa5c53ee47637456b9ccc25.webm?t=1766732363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755100/extras/666be072efa5c53ee47637456b9ccc25.mp4?t=1766732363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen different areas\u00a0to find, each with their own unique colors, strange flora, lore, and cute/creepy creatures. Explorable in many different orders<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755100/extras/5c01302f0d8ad8f78c75903dcf80e643.poster.avif?t=1766732363\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755100/extras/5c01302f0d8ad8f78c75903dcf80e643.webm?t=1766732363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755100/extras/5c01302f0d8ad8f78c75903dcf80e643.mp4?t=1766732363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise platforming to do between all the exploring and fighting you're about to do</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755100/extras/cf483d02d8b4e0a02352cf143d670fc2.poster.avif?t=1766732363\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755100/extras/cf483d02d8b4e0a02352cf143d670fc2.webm?t=1766732363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755100/extras/cf483d